# OODA-TUI - Help

File: help.oot

Coding agent. Conversation up, compose down. Enter sends.
Write and bash ask first unless `/perm yolo` or `--yolo`.

## Usage

```
ooda-tui [--teamwork] [--yolo] [--cwd PATH]
         [--provider NAME] [--model NAME] [--theme NAME]
         [--no-color] [--token <sub> ...] [--help] [--version]
```

## Providers

| Name | Aliases | Default model | Key env |
|------|---------|---------------|---------|
| muse | meta, spark | muse-spark-1.3 | OODA_MUSE_API_KEY or OODA_MODEL_API_KEY |
| minimax | | MiniMax-M2.5 | OODA_MINIMAX_API_KEY |
| mistral | vibe | mistral-large-latest | OODA_MISTRAL_API_KEY or OODA_VIBE_API_KEY |

```
/login muse <key>
/login minimax <key>
/login mistral <key>
```

Keys persist to `$OODA_HOME/.config/ooda-tui/config.oot` or `./.ooda-tui.oot`.

## Slash

`/login <provider> [key]`  `/logout`  `/providers`
`/model [name]`  `/model provider:model`  `/provider [name]`
`/theme [1982|minimax]`  `/cwd [path]`
`/plan [text]`  `/goal [text]`
`/btw <question>`  aside, does not change the plan
`/team on|off|init|run`
`/init` writes AGENTS.md. `/perm ask|allow|yolo`. `/mode build|plan`.
`/clear` `/compact` `/resume` `/rename` `/settings` `/status` `/help` `/exit`

Tools the model may call: read, grep, glob, write, bash (cwd-capped).

## Flags

`--teamwork` `--yolo` `--cwd PATH` `--no-color`
`--provider NAME` `--model NAME` `--theme NAME`
`--token <sub>` `--help` `--version`

## Env

`OODACODEX` optional. `OODA_HOME` config root. `OODA_NO_COLOR=1` disables color.
`OODA_TUI_VERSION` overrides the version string.

## Examples

```
ooda
/login muse "$OODA_MUSE_API_KEY"
hello, what can you see in this repo?
/btw what model am I on?
/exit
```
